            <sparkle:version>197</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.36</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>&quot;Launch at login&quot; now survives app updates. If an update ever drops the macOS login-item registration, Corder re-registers it on the next launch instead of silently turning the setting off — you no longer have to re-toggle it after updating.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
